<content contentuid="h6b048153gfa39g4031gbfaegd49348801f37" version="1">ULTRA设置</content>
<content contentuid="h72eabf08g3922g4a85ga1cfgd121f7695885" version="1">管理隐藏模式及其勇士召唤池。</content>
<content contentuid="h4287c651ga8c3g4f81ga53dg7a1d4b3b9e2c" version="1">将此勇士移出召唤池，或将其重新加入。</content>
<content contentuid="h754421d6ge124g482bg960eg5cb816c2d589" version="1">DISABLE ULTRA</content>
<content contentuid="h66f4165dg9208g4199gb7e7g2ec375144659" version="1">永久关闭隐藏模式。将其从热键栏移除，你多半用不上它。</content>
<content contentuid="h1d03c2ffg3898g48a8gabcdg7ccf9aefc5eb" version="1">&lt;b&gt;永久关闭隐藏模式？&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;一旦关闭，便永不复返。</content>
<content contentuid="h5c5aaafdgd045g4b06g8c0bg96cc3a6c201c" version="1">&lt;b&gt;千真万确、绝对确定？&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;勇士们将再也不会介入你的战斗。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;没有人会评判你。几乎没有。</content>
<content contentuid="h922f5c56g92a5g4f2ag897bga32d1a8e601d" version="1">&lt;b&gt;将此勇士移出召唤池？&lt;/b&gt;</content>
<content contentuid="h6c8f5950g9428g4e29ga216gf5773fc7025e" version="1">&lt;b&gt;将此勇士重新加入召唤池？&lt;/b&gt;</content>
<content contentuid="heb2f990dg9ecfg43f3ga869g0f594dd7ced6" version="1">&lt;b&gt;ULTRA已处于激活状态。&lt;/b&gt;</content>
<content contentuid="hc72c060agd3b6g47d4g99c6g1c311afb91d3" version="1">&lt;b&gt;召唤池中至少须保留一名勇士。&lt;/b&gt;</content>
